{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24320","headline":"喜杨六侍御同宿 · 白居易","name":"喜杨六侍御同宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸帻静言明月夜，匡牀闲卧落花朝。\n二三月里饶春睡，七八年来不早朝。\n浊水清尘难会合，高鹏低鷃各逍遥。\n眼看又上青云去，更卜同衾一两宵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}